{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act3d0_level_act3d0_05_end",
  "groupId": "act3d0",
  "stageId": "a003_05",
  "title": "別阻止我",
  "storyCode": "OF-5",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "45ae755287d20845e3719978416da76ea9ddab002f577d434498d631724ff5dd",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#5",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "黑，我在維多利亞留學這麼多年，並不是在虛度光陰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#5",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "我在那裡學習了與天災和源石有關的，最先進的科學技術。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#5",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "對你來說或許是天方夜譚的事，對我來說卻是理所當然並且正在發生的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#5",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "我所學習的知識，我所信奉的理論，它們都在告訴我我的判斷是正確的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
      "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "小姐你學的並不是法學。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#5",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "嗯......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
      "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "羅德島在市政廳做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "搜集克洛寧的罪證。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
      "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "克洛寧也許很壞，卻沒有那麼蠢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "作為天災信使他不可能不知道現在火山的狀況有問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "他一定是因為自己的盤算才掩蓋事實的，只要暗暗搜集他的罪證......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
      "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "我認為羅德島和他會正面衝突，所謂暗中搜集證據，不可能成功。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "沒，沒關係！只要你不在就......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
      "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "小姐，我想知道你為什麼要這麼做。如果我能得到一個合理的答案，我不會追究羅德島。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "......我必須這麼做。我不相信父親是無血無肉的人，他絕對不會看著這種事情發生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "父親愛著這個城市，比誰都愛，沒有人比我更清楚這一點了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
      "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "你還恨他嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "為什麼？如果該恨的話，應該是父親恨我，因為我的出生帶走了母親......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "但他從來沒有這麼做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "我只是討厭他不肯把事情說出來，把所有事情全都安排好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "看起來好像是在保護我，實際上卻害得我什麼都不知道，什麼都做不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "就連這次也一樣！一定是克洛寧矇騙了父親，讓他對火山爆發的事情完全不知情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "所以父親才會讓克洛寧阻止我發佈報告！這不叫恨吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
      "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "火山爆發？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
      "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "克洛寧說的是，小姐準備把老爺過去的機密事件全部抖露，讓老爺退職，接受審判。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "啊？不，我父親過去做了些什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#5",
      "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "不，沒什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#5",
      "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "......唔，原來是這樣，我知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "所以克洛寧也不是因為父親的命令才阻攔我的。呼，我也差不多明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "黑，如果真是那種事，我會請求更具備法律效力的管道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "我所做的自然也是為了這個城市，為了我的故鄉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
      "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "我明白了。小姐並不在乎過去的事情，也不在乎所謂的名譽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
      "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "我和小姐一樣，老爺也一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#5",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "呼。不管別人怎麼猜想，我選擇相信你，相信父親。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#5",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "即使是目的產生了衝突，我也知道，這是我們兩個人之間的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#5",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "所以我相信，和我一樣瞭解這個城市的你，一定會知道我會在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#5",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "這樣，你就會親自來阻止我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#4",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "說起來，市長是誰都無所謂吧？父親也一定會這麼覺得。他在乎的，不也是這個城市嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#4",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "所以，父親一定會同意我的觀點的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#4",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "黑......我說的對嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#5",
      "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "你長大了，小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
